<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8"/>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Harthill WWTW — Site Survey Photos</title>
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
      background: #0d1117;
      color: #e6edf3;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 2rem 1rem;
    }

    header {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 960px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .header-left { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; }

    .logo { height: 32px; opacity: 0.9; }

    .header-title h1 {
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #e6edf3;
      line-height: 1.3;
    }

    .header-title p {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #7d8590;
      margin-top: 2px;
    }

    .badge {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 500;
      padding: 3px 10px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid #30363d;
      color: #7d8590;
    }

    .gallery {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 960px;
      background: #161b22;
      border: 1px solid #30363d;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .main-stage {
      position: relative;
      background: #0d1117;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      min-height: 520px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    #mainImg {
      max-width: 100%;
      max-height: 560px;
      object-fit: contain;
      display: block;
      transition: opacity 0.15s ease;
    }

    #mainImg.loading { opacity: 0; }

    .nav-btn {
      position: absolute;
      top: 50%;
      transform: translateY(-50%);
      background: rgba(22, 27, 34, 0.85);
      border: 1px solid #30363d;
      border-radius: 8px;
      width: 42px;
      height: 42px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      cursor: pointer;
      color: #e6edf3;
      font-size: 20px;
      z-index: 2;
      transition: background 0.15s, transform 0.1s;
      user-select: none;
    }

    .nav-btn:hover { background: rgba(48, 54, 61, 0.95); }
    .nav-btn:active { transform: translateY(-50%) scale(0.94); }
    .nav-prev { left: 14px; }
    .nav-next { right: 14px; }

    .gallery-footer {
      border-top: 1px solid #30363d;
      padding: 12px 16px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .footer-meta {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .counter {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: #7d8590;
    }

    .counter span { color: #e6edf3; }

    .kb-hint {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: #484f58;
    }

    .kb-hint kbd {
      background: #21262d;
      border: 1px solid #30363d;
      border-radius: 4px;
      padding: 1px 5px;
      font-size: 10px;
      font-family: inherit;
      color: #7d8590;
    }

    .thumb-strip {
      display: flex;
      gap: 5px;
      overflow-x: auto;
      padding-bottom: 4px;
      scrollbar-width: thin;
      scrollbar-color: #30363d transparent;
    }

    .thumb-strip::-webkit-scrollbar { height: 4px; }
    .thumb-strip::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: transparent; }
    .thumb-strip::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #30363d; border-radius: 2px; }

    .thumb {
      width: 60px;
      height: 60px;
      object-fit: cover;
      border-radius: 6px;
      cursor: pointer;
      border: 2px solid transparent;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      opacity: 0.45;
      transition: opacity 0.15s, border-color 0.15s;
    }

    .thumb:hover { opacity: 0.8; }
    .thumb.active { border-color: #1f6feb; opacity: 1; }

    .progress-bar {
      height: 2px;
      background: #21262d;
      border-radius: 1px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .progress-fill {
      height: 100%;
      background: #1f6feb;
      border-radius: 1px;
      transition: width 0.2s ease;
    }

    .lightbox-overlay {
      display: none;
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      background: rgba(1, 4, 9, 0.92);
      z-index: 100;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      cursor: zoom-out;
    }

    .lightbox-overlay.open { display: flex; }

    .lightbox-overlay img {
      max-width: 95vw;
      max-height: 95vh;
      object-fit: contain;
      border-radius: 8px;
      cursor: default;
    }

    .lightbox-close {
      position: fixed;
      top: 16px;
      right: 20px;
      font-size: 28px;
      color: #7d8590;
      cursor: pointer;
      line-height: 1;
      z-index: 101;
    }

    .lightbox-close:hover { color: #e6edf3; }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .kb-hint { display: none; }
      .main-stage { min-height: 280px; }
      #mainImg { max-height: 320px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="header-left">
    <img class="logo" src="https://www.ross-eng.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/02/rse-logo-dark.png" alt="RSE"/>
    <div class="header-title">
      <h1>Harthill WWTW — Site Survey</h1>
      <p>Non-intrusive survey · Cameron Paton · November 2025</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <span class="badge">63 photos</span>
</header>

<div class="gallery">
  <div class="main-stage" id="stage">
    <img id="mainImg" alt="Site survey photo"/>
    <button class="nav-btn nav-prev" id="prevBtn" aria-label="Previous">&#8249;</button>
    <button class="nav-btn nav-next" id="nextBtn" aria-label="Next">&#8250;</button>
  </div>

  <div class="gallery-footer">
    <div class="progress-bar"><div class="progress-fill" id="progress"></div></div>
    <div class="footer-meta">
      <span class="counter">Photo <span id="counterNum">1</span> of 63</span>
      <span class="kb-hint"><kbd>←</kbd> <kbd>→</kbd> to navigate &nbsp;·&nbsp; click image to zoom</span>
    </div>
    <div class="thumb-strip" id="thumbStrip"></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="lightbox-overlay" id="lightbox">
  <span class="lightbox-close" id="lightboxClose">&times;</span>
  <img id="lightboxImg" alt=""/>
</div>

